                "backendName": "triggerRecurrence",
                "description_en": "The running mode when triggered. This parameter takes effect only when TriggerType is set to Scheduler.\n\nNormal: A normal scheduled task that is triggered by regular scheduling.\nManual: A manual task that is not triggered by regular scheduling.\nPause: A paused task that is triggered by regular scheduling but is set to failed when scheduling starts.\nSkip: A dry-run task that is triggered by regular scheduling but is set to successful when scheduling starts.\nSkipUnchoose: A task that is not selected in a temporary workflow. This type exists only in temporary workflows and is set to successful when scheduling starts.\nSkipCycle: A weekly or monthly task whose running cycle has not arrived. The task is triggered by regular scheduling but is set to successful when scheduling starts.\nConditionUnchoose: A downstream task that is not selected by an upstream branch (IF) node and directly becomes a dry run.\nRealtimeDeprecated: An expired periodic instance generated in real time. Instances of this type are directly set to successful.\nPauseCalendar: An instance that is paused because a calendar is referenced.\nSkipCalendar: An instance that becomes a dry run because a calendar is referenced",
                "description_zh": "触发时的运行模式。TriggerType=Scheduler时生效。\n\nNormal: 正常调度任务，被日常调度。\nManual: 手动任务，不会被日常调度。\nPause: 暂停任务，被日常调度，但启动调度时直接被置为失败。\nSkip: 空跑任务，被日常调度，但启动调度时直接被置为成功。\nSkipUnchoose: 临时工作流中未选择的任务，仅存在于临时工作流中，启动调度时直接被置为成功。\nSkipCycle: 未到运行周期的周月任务，被日常调度，但启动调度时直接被置为成功。\nConditionUnchoose: 上游实例中有分支（IF）节点，但是该下游节点未被分支节点选中，直接变成空跑。\nRealtimeDeprecated: 实时生成的已经过期的周期实例，遇到该类型的直接置成功。\nPauseCalendar: 引用了日历导致实例暂停。\nSkipCalendar: 引用了日历导致实例空跑",
